       "code": "-- Lab 1.3 part B: create the FEWEST indexes that make all four queries fast.\n-- Rules the tests check: no query may use a sequential scan on events; Q3 must need no Sort step;\n-- at most 3 indexes besides the primary key; every index you create must actually be used by one of the queries.\n-- Example syntax:  CREATE INDEX idx_name ON events (col1, col2 DESC);"
