    "title": {
     "id": "Komputasi Terdistribusi dan Internal Apache Spark",
     "en": "Distributed Computing and Apache Spark Internals"
    },
    "duration": {
     "id": "4 minggu",
     "en": "4 weeks"
    },
    "summary": {
     "id": "Pahami bagaimana Apache Spark membagi beban komputasi ke klaster mesin, pelajari cara membaca physical execution plans, serta kenali dan atasi masalah paling krusial di dunia nyata (shuffle networks, bad joins, data skew) melalui pengukuran nyata pada dataset dengan hot key.",
     "en": "Understand how Spark splits work across machines, read its execution plans, and recognise and fix the problems that matter most (shuffles, bad joins, data skew) using real measurements from a hot-key dataset."
    },
    "whyTutorialsLie": {
     "id": "Banyak kursus hanya mengajarkan cara memanggil groupBy().count() di tutorial mainan. Di lingkungan produksi nyata, sebuah job 100 GB bisa tersangkut di angka 99% selama berjam-jam karena satu key menampung mayoritas baris data, satu task memikul seluruh beban komputasi, sementara ratusan core klaster menganggur menunggunya.",
     "en": "Courses say \"just call groupBy().count()\". In production a 100 GB job sits at 99% for hours because one key holds most of the rows, one task does almost all the work, and the cluster idles while it waits."
    },
