     "scenario": {
      "id": "Pada pukul 08:30 di hari Senin yang hujan, arus kendaraan komuter memasuki terowongan tol bawah laut sepanjang 3 kilometer. Koneksi jaringan seluler terputus total bagi ribuan kendaraan. Ketika armada keluar dari terowongan 12 menit kemudian, perangkat telematika di dalam kendaraan memancarkan 45.000 event penyelesaian perjalanan GPS yang tertimbun ke klaster Kafka pusat dalam durasi kurang dari lima detik.\n\nAplikasi streaming lama milik tim data mengelompokkan data berdasarkan **processing time** (menggunakan fungsi `datetime.now()` saat data tiba di server penampung). Hanya dalam lima detik, window processing time 08:42 mencatat 45.000 perjalanan selesai, sedangkan window antara pukul 08:30 hingga 08:41 tercatat kosong melompong dengan 0 perjalanan. Algoritma otomatis membaca terjadi lonjakan permintaan tak terduga, melipatgandakan tarif penumpang sebesar 4,5x dan mengirimkan armada kosong darurat ke mulut terowongan. Di saat bersamaan, laporan pendapatan pengemudi mencatat nol pemasukan selama 12 menit di terowongan, memicu ratusan tiket komplain ke layanan bantuan.",
      "en": "At 08:30 on a rainy Monday morning, commuter vehicle traffic entered a major 3-kilometer highway tunnel under the bay. Cellular signal dropped completely for thousands of vehicles. When vehicles exited the tunnel 12 minutes later, their onboard telematics devices flushed 45,000 buffered GPS trip completion events into the central Kafka cluster in less than five seconds.\n\nThe engineering team's legacy stream processing job grouped incoming records by **processing time** (using `datetime.now()` at the ingestion server). Within five seconds, the 08:42 processing-time window recorded 45,000 completed trips, while the windows between 08:30 and 08:41 recorded zero trips. An automated demand algorithm flagged an unprecedented demand surge, multiplying dynamic passenger fares by 4.5x and dispatching dozens of empty emergency support vans to the tunnel exit. Concurrently, driver earnings reports calculated zero trips during the tunnel crossing, triggering hundreds of support tickets."
     },
     "breakageReason": {
      "id": "Aplikasi lama mencampuradukkan waktu kedatangan paket di jaringan dengan waktu kejadian fisik di lapangan. Karena tidak menggunakan windowing berbasis event time dan tidak melacak watermark, fluktuasi latensi jaringan disalahartikan sebagai perubahan permintaan nyata di dunia fisik.",
      "en": "The legacy processor conflated ingestion arrival time with physical event occurrence time. Because it lacked event-time windowing and watermark tracking, network transit delays were falsely interpreted as physical real-world demand swings."
     },
     "fixGuide": {
      "id": "1. **Beralih ke event time murni:** Batas interval window wajib dihitung secara ketat dari timestamp GPS sensor armada (`event_time`).\n2. **Terapkan bounded watermark:** Majukan watermark secara monotonik dengan jeda toleransi keterlambatan yang memadai (misalnya 15 menit untuk perjalanan lintas terowongan).\n3. **Karantina data yang benar-benar kedaluwarsa:** Jika event baru tiba setelah batas toleransi 15 menit berakhir, tolak event tersebut dari window operasional aktif dan salurkan ke Dead-Letter Queue untuk diaudit di luar alur transaksi utama.",
      "en": "1. **Switch to event time:** Window boundaries must be computed strictly from the vehicle sensor's GPS timestamp (`event_time`).\n2. **Implement bounded watermarks:** Advance watermark monotonically with a configured allowed lateness delay (e.g., 15 minutes for highway transit).\n3. **Quarantine true stragglers:** If an event arrives after its 15-minute watermark window has closed, reject it from active real-time operational windows and route it to an auditable Dead-Letter Queue for offline reconciliation."
     },
     "defensivePattern": {
      "id": "Pisahkan secara mutlak antara event time dan waktu kedatangan jaringan dalam seluruh arsitektur data real-time. Terima data yang out of order selama masih dalam batas toleransi watermark, pertahankan akumulator aktif saat terjadi restart sistem, dan isolasi data yang terlambat ke dalam DLQ tanpa mencemari window analitik produksi yang telah diterbitkan.",
      "en": "Decouple event time from network arrival time in all real-time architectures. Allow out-of-order events within a bounded watermark delay, preserve in-flight accumulators across restarts, and isolate late data into a DLQ without polluting finalized production windows."
     }
