       "en": "In sliding windows, the number of overlapping windows containing any timestamp is `(duration / slide)`. With duration 300s and slide 60s, `(300 / 60) = 5`. The event belongs to all five windows spanning `[1704067020, 1704067320)` through `[1704067260, 1704067560)`."
