       "en": "Idempotent storage writes ensure that replaying an event batch produces identical database state. By creating a composite primary key on `(window_start, window_end, zone_id)` and executing an upsert (staging table insert followed by atomic replace), re-emitted windows overwrite stale state without duplicating rows."
